# Children contents: objects added to the model. The new text is the normalized pretty-print of the new object, indented like its siblings.

=== add a concept at the end of a unit
--- source
unit U {
	concept A {
	}
}
--- edit
add concept B
--- expect
unit U {
	concept A {
	}
	concept B {
	}
}

=== add an abstract concept with a parent at the end
--- source
unit U {
	concept A {
	}
}
--- edit
add concept B abstract extends A
--- expect
unit U {
	concept A {
	}
	abstract concept B extends A {
	}
}

=== add a concept in an empty unit
--- source
unit U {
}
--- edit
add concept A
--- expect
unit U {
	concept A {
	}
}

=== add a concept at the start of a unit
known-defect: P2PP-D-8
--- source
unit U {
	concept A {
	}
	concept B {
	}
}
--- edit
add concept Z at 0
--- expect
unit U {
	concept Z {
	}
	concept A {
	}
	concept B {
	}
}

=== add a concept in the middle of a unit
--- source
unit U {
	concept A {
	}
	concept B {
	}
}
--- edit
add concept Z at 1
--- expect
unit U {
	concept A {
	}
	concept Z {
	}
	concept B {
	}
}

